---
import Layout from '~/layouts/PageLayout.astro';

const metadata = {
  title: '关于',
};

const introItems = [
  '学生党一枚',
  '追番狂人·兼·京阿尼狂热信徒',
  '前端开发什么都不会（当然是假的）',
  '后端开发也什么都不会（可能是真的）',
];
---

<Layout metadata={metadata}>
  <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
    <header
      class="text-center mb-12 intersect-once intersect-quarter intersect-no-queue motion-safe:md:opacity-0 motion-safe:md:intersect:animate-fade"
    >
      <h1 class="font-bold text-3xl text-black dark:text-white mb-3">关于我</h1>
    </header>

    <div
      class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-10 items-start intersect-once intersect-quarter intersect-no-queue motion-safe:md:opacity-0 motion-safe:md:intersect:animate-fade"
    >
      <div class="flex flex-col items-center w-full sm:w-48 shrink-0 text-center">
        <img
          src="/avatar.jpg"
          alt="头像"
          class="w-40 h-40 sm:w-44 sm:h-44 rounded-full object-cover border-3 border-gray-200 dark:border-slate-700"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>

      <div class="flex-1 space-y-4 text-gray-700 dark:text-slate-200 leading-relaxed">
        {
          introItems.map((item) => (
            <p class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <span
                class="mt-2 inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#4a74ad] shrink-0"
                aria-hidden="true"
              ></span>
              <span>{item}</span>
            </p>
          ))
        }
        <p class="flex items-start gap-3">
          <span
            class="mt-2 inline-block w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#4a74ad] shrink-0"
            aria-hidden="true"
          ></span>
          <span class="font-serif italic text-lg text-gray-800 dark:text-slate-100">
            “In case I don't see you, good afternoon, good evening, and good night.”
          </span>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h2
      class="font-bold text-center text-3xl text-black dark:text-white mt-20 mb-8 intersect-once intersect-quarter intersect-no-queue motion-safe:md:opacity-0 motion-safe:md:intersect:animate-fade"
    >
      关于本站
    </h2>
    <div
      class="space-y-5 text-gray-700 dark:text-slate-200 leading-relaxed intersect-once intersect-quarter intersect-no-queue motion-safe:md:opacity-0 motion-safe:md:intersect:animate-fade"
    >
      <p>本站完全是某只猫猫一时兴起的产物，开发的时间还没备案的时间长。</p>

      <p>本站全面采用 Astro + Tailwind 开发。</p>

      <div class="space-y-4">
        <p class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <img src="/deepseek-logo.svg" alt="DeepSeek" class="h-6 w-auto" width="114" height="24" />
          <span>本站的 AI agent 为凉白开的 DeepSeek V4 系列（包括 Flash、Flash Vision Exp、Pro）</span>
        </p>
        <p class="text-muted line-through">
          别问为什么叫凉白开而不是梁圣 大肥鱼涨价了那也没办法啊 该骂
        </p>
      </div>

      <p>本站主题最初为完全默认的 Fuwari，后改为 Astrowind（魔改版）。</p>

      <div class="space-y-4">
        <p>
          本站目前的前端工具 0 框架，全部采用手搓 DOM
          <span class="text-muted line-through"> 我说大肥鱼神力你尔多龙吗</span>
        </p>
        <p>第一次打开需要下载 ffmpeg.wasm。采用阿里云加速源，速度应该还行。</p>
        <p class="text-muted text-sm">
          （注意：由于多线程 ffmpeg 配置极其繁琐且兼容性极差，目前为单线程版本）
        </p>
        <p>
          如果效果不佳建议前往
          <a
            href="https://ezgif.com"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 hover:underline"
          >
            Ezgif.com
          </a>
          ，效果极佳。
        </p>
      </div>

      <p class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <img src="/aliyun-logo.svg" alt="阿里云" class="h-6 w-auto" width="120" height="20" />
        <span>本站现托管在阿里云的 ESA 上。</span>
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>